OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for attacking two
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court heard how two female police
OL,7,Fofficers both feared for their lives
OL,8,Fwhen a man assaulted them in a hotel
OL,9,Froom.
OL,11,FXander Butler, 23, of Willoughby Road,
OL,12,FIpswich, was jailed for 16 months at
OL,13,FIpswich Crown Court on Thursday after
OL,14,Fpleading guilty to intentional
OL,15,Fstrangulation, assault by beating of an
OL,16,Femergency worker and criminal damage.
OL,18,FThe hearing was told two female
OL,19,Fofficers had gone to a hotel in Capel
OL,20,FSt Mary on 29 July after reports of a
OL,21,Fman causing disruption.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
