OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for attacking two
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a victim impact statement, one of
OL,7,Fthe officers wrote: "Not only was I
OL,8,Fbeing assaulted myself, but I was
OL,9,Fforced to watch as my colleague was
OL,10,Falso assaulted, leaving me feeling
OL,11,Fcompletely helpless."
